| --- | --- | --- |
| Rust compiler | 1.99.1 | [toolchain](backend/rust-toolchain.toml), [Dockerfile](Dockerfile) builder tag/digest and explicit `cargo +1.99.1`, [security tools](scripts/security-tools.json) installer toolchain |
| Rust MSRV | 1.99 | [Cargo manifest](backend/Cargo.toml), dependency MSRVs and your supported-target tests |
